  "title": "What Is an Ambient AI Scribe—and Should Your Practice Be Using One in 2025?",
  "summary": "Ambient AI scribes are voice-enabled tools that automatically generate medical notes during patient visits, helping providers reduce documentation time and focus more on patient care. While they offer major efficiency and burnout relief benefits, practices must weigh risks like accuracy issues and data privacy before adopting widely in 2025.",
